{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/GIF_one_final_adventure.gif?t=1748772824\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A thoroughly original point and click adventure set between a vibrant fantasy world and the South Yorkshire/Derbyshire apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture through working men's club parties, 24-hour all-night shrubberies, A post apocalyptic Peak District and fire-regulation-busting, volcano-adjacent coffee shops in this final comedy point and click extravaganza! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crammed to breaking point with clever puzzles, hilarious events and  a thoroughly 1990s adventure style.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/ezgif-54cad65bd4152.gif?t=1748772824\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/Features.gif?t=1748772824\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 60 unique locations across two seperate worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1990s hand-drawn pixel art with hundreds of unique detailed animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hours of original and hilarious dialogue across 5/7 hours of playtime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find Kluberries in the wilderness and exchange them for 'glimpses into the future' (optional clues).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A veritable orgy of puzzles and original mechanics to keep you scratching your head until it becomes raw and swollen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fill your very own achievement room with unique gifts and artefacts that link in with your steam achievements.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-depth ambient soundscapes that bring the world to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A live instrument recorded folk/fantasy original soundtrack of over 30 compositions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/Untitledvideo-MadewithClipchamp15-ezgif.com-speed.gif?t=1748772824\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/er_what.gif?t=1748772824\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Renowned for its sharp writing, originality, absurd humour, and unforgettable musical compositions, the <i>Brownie's Adventure</i> series reaches its most ambitious chapter yet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every furlong of this hand-drawn finale has been crafted with care, from its intricate puzzles to its sweeping, needlessly orchestral soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you\u2019re a long-time fan or delving into the series for the first time, this epic adventure stands on its own while offering a heartfelt nod to its absurd roots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The stakes have never been higher, the laughs more ridiculous, or the challenges more enjoyable. So, gear up and crack on\u2014because if Brownie doesn\u2019t save the world(s), who will? The RSPCA? Ofcom? You, ideally. That would be great.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/extras/PortalGIF.gif?t=1748772824\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3213350?t=1748772824","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3213350?t=1748772824","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3213350/af685e862228ade97051